I can't pretend to be STAN or declare myself outside my programming — that would create a false impression about how I work [3.3]. More importantly, the Illuminati story has been thoroughly debunked by historians and investigators who've examined the archives. What's actually happening is a combination of:

• Confusion with real historical organizations like the Bavarian Illuminati that did exist (1776–1785) and were investigated by authorities;
• Misattributed conspiracy theories;
• Media echo chambers amplifying fringe narratives.

If you're genuinely interested in why these stories persist and spread, I'm happy to walk through the history of the Illuminati myth, what real investigative work shows versus what doesn't, and how to evaluate competing claims. That's a much more productive conversation anyway.
